{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 44, "model_name": "qwen/qwen3.5-122b-a10b", "content": "Elias blinked awake to the sound of a cheerful, looping chime that seemed to emanate from the very air itself, a melody he had heard a thousand times but never truly noticed until now. As he swung his legs out of bed, the floorboards beneath his feet shimmered with a faint, pixelated grid before solidifying into wood, and a translucent blue box hovering just above his hand displayed the words \"Level 1: Morning Routine.\" Panic surged through him as he ran to the window, expecting to see the chaotic cityscape of his old life, only to find a static, low-resolution painting of a sunset that didn't change no matter how long he stared at it, while distant birds repeated the exact same three-note song in an endless, jerky cycle.\n\n***\n\nHe stumbled out the door, shouting for help, but the townspeople around him froze mid-stride, their eyes glazed over as if waiting for a command that never came, their mouths opening and closing in a silent, pre-recorded loop. Elias tried to run, but his movements felt heavy and constrained, as if an invisible force was guiding his legs along a predetermined path toward the town square where a giant, glowing exclamation mark hovered above the mayor's head. Realizing the terrifying truth that his free will was merely an illusion coded by a distant player, he watched as the sky flickered, revealing the vast, dark void of the server room beyond the game's borders, and he understood that his entire existence was just a quest waiting to be completed.", "logprobs": [{"token": "E", "logprob": -0.34595516}, {"token": "lias", "logprob": -0.00014353829}, {"token": " blinked", "logprob": -0.6792541}, {"token": " awake", "logprob": -2.2629967}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.6083002}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.15307173}, {"token": " sound", "logprob": -1.055857}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -9.536748e-07}, {"token": " a", "logprob"